ision\" data-number=\"14°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">,</span></li>\n                <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"22°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et</span></li>\n                <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"23°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">à moins que ceux-ci ne surgissent aux cours des vacances;</span></li>\n            </ol>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>",
